  "note": [
    "`test: null` means the whole suite. Individual cases may narrow it, but the",
    "default is deliberate: several of these mutants are killed by a file other",
    "than the obvious one, and a narrowed run would report a survivor.",
    "",
    "Group A is layer 1 — the sacred surface. Four of its five entries survived",
    "the entire suite when they were first written, because the only assertion",
    "touching those values was a range check the formula's whole codomain",
    "satisfied.",
    "",
    "Group B is layer 2, the emitted document. Group C is the rasterizer.",
    "Group D deletes whole capabilities rather than perturbing them.",
    "",
    "**Group D's vertical-pass case went stale at `b5be6c8` (#80)** and was",
    "re-derived in #106. The banding rework turned every costly loop into a",
    "`sync*` generator, so `_boxPass(...)` became `yield* _boxPassSteps(...)`",
    "and this file's `from` stopped matching — silently, because nothing",
    "re-ran it between #80 and #45's gate check. The mutation is the same",
    "mechanism (delete the vertical pass, keep the horizontal one), not a",
    "string touched up to compile."
